## portus.rate_limit — límite de peticiones por cliente en ventana fija.
##
## El cliente se identifica por el primer valor de `X-Forwarded-For` (o
## `"local"`). El estado vive en memoria del proceso y se recicla cuando pasa
## la ventana; si la tabla crece por encima de `MAX_CLIENTS` se vacía entera
## para acotar la memoria.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## calling portus.use_rate_limit with sigil of app, 60, 60000
## ```
import std.arena as arena_module
import std.scrolls
import portus.application as application_module
import portus.context as context_module
import portus.error as error_module
import portus.handler as handler_module
import portus.native as native_module
import portus.text as text

## Clientes recordados antes de vaciar la tabla.
const MAX_CLIENTS as int is 4096

## Configuración del límite.
rune Rule:
    ## Peticiones permitidas por ventana.
    max_requests as int
    ## Ventana en milisegundos.
    window_ms as long

## Contador de un cliente.
rune Slot:
    ## Peticiones en la ventana.
    count as int
    ## Fin de la ventana (ms monótonos).
    reset_at as long

## Tabla de contadores. Es el sujeto de este módulo.
weave slots into ref to map of string to Slot:
    static var table as map of string to Slot is map of string to Slot
    return sigil of table

## Identifica al cliente.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve un string propio; libéralo con `banish`.
weave client_key with context as ref to context_module.Context into string:
    let forwarded as maybe string is calling context.header with "x-forwarded-for"
    if forwarded.is_present:
        var raw as string is forwarded.value
        var comma as int is -1
        var i as int is 0
        while i < (calling scrolls.len with raw):
            if (raw at i) == ",":
                set comma is i
                set i is calling scrolls.len with raw
            else:
                set i is i + 1
        if comma > 0:
            return calling scrolls.substring with raw, 0, comma
        return calling text.copy with raw
    return calling text.copy with "local"

## Cuenta la petición y responde 429 si se pasa del límite.
weave _limit with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to error_module.HttpError:
    var rule as ref to Rule is transmute data to ref to Rule
    var table as ref to map of string to Slot is calling slots
    var key as string is calling client_key with context
    var now as long is calling native_module.portus_native_now_ms
    var count as int is 1
    var reset_at as long is now + rule->window_ms
    if calling table.contains with key:
        var current as Slot is calling table.get with key
        if current.reset_at > now:
            set count is current.count + 1
            set reset_at is current.reset_at
    if calling table.len >= MAX_CLIENTS:
        calling table.clear
    calling table.put with key, (with count is count, reset_at is reset_at)
    if count <= rule->max_requests:
        return calling handler_module.ok_void
    var retry as int is 1
    if reset_at > now:
        set retry is ((reset_at - now) / 1000) to int
        if retry < 1:
            set retry is 1
    calling context.set_status with 429
    var retry_text as string is "{retry}"
    defer banish retry_text
    calling context.set_header with "Retry-After", retry_text
    var body as string is "demasiadas peticiones"
    defer banish body
    calling context.send_text with body
    calling context.mark_sent
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## Convierte la configuración en el `data` opaco del middleware.
antiquus _raw_rule with rule as ref to Rule into ref to void:
    r"""
return (void *)rule;
"""

## Aplica el límite solo a las rutas bajo `prefix`.
weave use_at with app as ref to application_module.Application, prefix as string, max_requests as int, window_ms as long into void:
    var arena as ref to arena_module.Arena is calling application_module.arena_of with app
    var rule as ref to Rule is calling arena_module.arena_alloc_one of Rule with arena
    set rule->max_requests is max_requests
    set rule->window_ms is window_ms
    calling application_module.use_at with app, prefix, (calling handler_module.middleware_with with _limit, (calling _raw_rule with rule))
    return

## Aplica el límite a toda la aplicación.
weave use with app as ref to application_module.Application, max_requests as int, window_ms as long into void:
    var arena as ref to arena_module.Arena is calling application_module.arena_of with app
    var rule as ref to Rule is calling arena_module.arena_alloc_one of Rule with arena
    set rule->max_requests is max_requests
    set rule->window_ms is window_ms
    calling application_module.use with app, (calling handler_module.middleware_with with _limit, (calling _raw_rule with rule))
    return
